  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Making a big cake is a lot of work... With how much love was baked
        into you should savor each bite. Make sure to leave some for the rest of
        us though.
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3be242fd8c69cb04ea12ee80ec7a0339, type: 3}
    - Dialogue: " Next year I\u2019ll be sure to make an even bigger one for you."
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ac419e742a52675469ffd17ad86add74, type: 3}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I was a little sad that it was so small... Couldn\u2019t you
